        "comment": "Just WOOOW\n\nI got this privilege of attending my neighbour's engagement here. Speaking of the ambience, It classy with all those GREEEEN lush around. It literallt gave me a vibe of 'Garden City'. Kudos to the designer who designed it. I couldn't take much pics of the stage though.\n\nThis place is not like other regular Banquet halls with uniformed lighting and filmy vibes. You can literally feel that positive vibes here. Events like Haldi, Shukrana and other small gathering of around 200 people is perfect to be held at tgis venue.\n\nThis Hall is situated on top level of Shopping complex with Roof open space.\nThe staffs are very friendly and it has a good parking space as well.",
