        "id": "ChIJeSVTQTUWrjsRfSeyoft6TUU-rev-2",
        "author": "RAVISHANKAR MEDAHALLI",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "\"Spacious and well-maintained hall with great dining options!\"\n\"I recently attended an event at White Petal Conventional Hall and was very impressed with the venue. The hall is incredibly spacious and can easily accommodate a large gathering of 1000+ people. The cleanliness of the hall was also remarkable, which is always a plus.\nOne of the things that stood out to me was the fact that the hall has two separate dining areas. This made it very convenient for guests to enjoy their meals without feeling crowded. The food was also delicious, and the service was top-notch.\nOverall, I had a wonderful experience at White Petal Conventional Hall. It's a great venue for any large event, and I would definitely recommend it to others.\"",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW9fDJkmoT1ig9o_6VywdFfiAzAyF0dNn-T3UMG_Cjg6LYWCPeS=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
