      {
        "id": "ChIJ1USPfEQWrjsRNL4aJSJfWp4-rev-0",
        "author": "Alamuri Ashok Reddy",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "I recently visited Tennis Pavilion for a wedding. The marriage hall was really good with a lot of open space. It is located next to Bangalore Palace.\n\nThe venue is well maintained and the function was well organized. There are dedicated dining halls for both men and women. I was especially impressed by the decoration on the main reception stage it was really beautiful.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUNTnE0eo0UyqbIvpMUptNhRx7klINC5b6eYOwQlEjv7vt7aI6mXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ1USPfEQWrjsRNL4aJSJfWp4-rev-1",
        "author": "Matloob Ali",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "This is a fantastic venue for big functions. the area is quite spacious. Had a really great time here!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7HMPBxhgSHWMRjeDYn3MsY2pdbAZvuLIyb5iuLIRJbiOeuCemQQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ1USPfEQWrjsRNL4aJSJfWp4-rev-2",
        "author": "PRAJWAL M S",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "The Tennis Pavilion is an excellent choice for hosting events and functions. It offers a very spacious open area, perfect for various activities, and a large, enclosed dining area for meals. The space is versatile and ideal for gatherings of all kinds.\n\nThe pavilion itself is fantastic—an expansive hall complemented by a huge lawn with lush grass. It provides ample space for a big gathering of more than 1,500 people, with plenty of parking to accommodate all your guests. The layout is thoughtful, with an open space at the entrance and a large, L-shaped hall at the back, providing plenty of room to serve and entertain guests. The facility is clean and well-maintained, ensuring a pleasant experience for all.\n\nHowever, it's worth noting that the approach road could use some repairs, as there are a few potholes that make the ride a bit bumpy. Despite this minor issue, the rest of the venue is well taken care of and offers a fantastic setting for any large event.\n\n#Bengaluru #NammaBengaluru",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU_-QC_kpNb7jlnWWLzJtvZ3t-1ktHQieF27SLaxSjBh-TKknZt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ1USPfEQWrjsRNL4aJSJfWp4-rev-3",
        "author": "Shaik Abdul Haleem",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "It's good. Lot of parking.  Inside ambience is good as well.  Lawn area is good, you can enjoy the evening",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIh1nj4_tkMRKXHWdeKd0CAgB6iMoE0nldaD1-uQR8db54nMQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ1USPfEQWrjsRNL4aJSJfWp4-rev-4",
        "author": "Faizan Mohamed",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Tennis Pavillion is an excellent venue that ticks all the right boxes for hosting a memorable event. The highlight of the hall is its beautifully designed stage, which serves as a perfect backdrop for weddings, receptions, and other celebrations. The attention to detail in the décor ensures that your special moments are captured in style.\n\nThe hall boasts ample parking space, which is a huge relief for guests and ensures a hassle-free experience. The spacious dining area is another big plus, allowing guests to enjoy their meals comfortably without feeling crowded.\n\nWith a well-maintained, elegant ambiance and professional management, Tennis Pavillion provides a seamless and pleasant experience. Highly recommended for those looking for a blend of functionality and aesthetics for their big day!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIrrVRkpkRyZWuj9319W315ybBKBGkSehEL77rn1CYYiCzkYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
