        "comment": "Large open space as well as a large hall to accommodate more than 5000 people. The dining hall is also very big. Lots of parking space but it can get muddy if it rains. The road leading to the venue from gate no 8 of palace grounds has worn out and the decorative lights are not working properly. At 4to5 lakh rupees rent per day one should expect better.",
