        "author": "Zaid Sayed",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "I highly recommend Srinagar Wedding Lawn in Palace Grounds. This exceptional venue boasts:\n\nExpansive, elegantly manicured lawn\nStunning entrance and ample parking\nLuxurious ambiance, ideal for large events (over 1,000 guests)\n\nRating: 5/5 stars.\n\nA premier event destination for weddings, receptions, and corporate events.",
