        "author": "ASH Last",
        "rating": 3,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "Had been to Shringara palace ground for a corporate event. It is no doubt centrally located and has ample parking space. The indoor venue is large for grand weddings and events and also has outdoor lawn with seating. There is also a separate area for dining and banquets. I give it a 3.5 star because the restrooms have a worn out look and looked unclean with non working taps etc.",
