        "rating": 3,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "The wedding hall is spacious and can comfortably accommodate a large number of guests. The interiors, lighting, and seating arrangement look good and create a pleasant atmosphere for family functions. The dining area is also well organized.\nHowever, the overall experience could be improved. Parking is limited during busy events, and service can be a bit slow when the hall is crowded. Better crowd management and quicker service would make the experience much better.\nOverall, it's a decent venue for weddings and other family events, but there is room for improvement",
