        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "We recently hosted an event at this banquet hall and had a wonderful experience. The venue is well-maintained, immaculate, and beautifully designed. The pleasant ambience ensured all our guests felt comfortable throughout the event. Additionally, the space was perfectly sized to accommodate our expected guest count. Overall, we were highly satisfied with the venue and found the management to be incredibly helpful and cooperative. We strongly recommend it for both small and large gatherings",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOecQhic9kvnIvB952R02c2OXQg-T871HOKWVB4-w0KgdDXg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
