        "author": "Akash Cm",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "We recently celebrated our baby’s birthday here and had a wonderful experience. The banquet hall is beautiful with very tasteful interiors that made for great photos. The arrangements were handled professionally, and everything was set up perfectly for the celebration. A great venue in the heart of Shivajinagar for family events!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWiKkmCsLuc74616E6WN3C3OernmlptyGbxxuo8uKZdp1czLD4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
