        "author": "Karthik Krishnam",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "Sathya Enclave Party hall is a well equipped function hall to host family events with modern amenities. I loved the ambience thanks to their lightings and decor. Owners are supportive and can also help with other vendor contacts to make your event hassle free and smooth experience overall for your memorable events. We hosted our daughters bday party this year and still remember how well it all turned out! Kudos to the management team!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIPJC2BX5ZzTEN8GEzmbnSB4mIiyyTqfB35_fLmD1xY23rjGQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
