        "author": "nanjundappa KG",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "Situated at Palace ground, Manikya is one of the Marriage Hall in a series of luxury marriage halls affordable only by Affluent Society. Rich greenery, High level peaceful, hygeinic to systematic seating arrangement, very very clean Wash rooms.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFhQRksVEi0BW3faB9IeAdror3aLa0GJ03YLqpbwDOtkeYdCsJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
