        "id": "ChIJd6bsMmAXrjsRhqgNSPdnn9c-rev-0",
        "author": "Anusha Boloor",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "We recently had a pleasure of hosting our engagement ceremony at Vasishka Banquet hall, which is located in the centre of the city, quite close to majestic railway, metro and  bus stations. First of all, huge thanks to Mahashook who helped us from the start to the end and ensured the whole process was smooth and as expected. The hall is well lit, A/C and huge that can easily fit 100+ pax and the food was amazing. Mahashook helped us with the decor and photography and he put us at ease arranging food for the outnumbered crowd. We booked our accomodation in the same hotel, Kanishka Grand (Although they did not provide us the rooms that we booked! Which is quite  annoying!). In case you need accommodations around there are plenty of reasonable stays that you can opt for.\nOver all really happy with the service provided by Mahashook, he truely made our day.  Thank you once again for the way you arranged and managed it beautifully.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWv2qrItJTvRI5qkfI4QuSgUdBTIdIrb5JWrB6EsQtN7oAbPsojxg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
