        "date": "9 months ago",
        "comment": "One of the best resorts for marriage, reception etc. Been here to attend a wedding and the management of entire event looked professional and thorough. Overall it was good experience being here. Plenty of parking is available. Staff in the parking area, housekeeping etc looked polite and professional.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWd4RP3nk3iW7-FxhC2CdGAcixhp7PjImzLoQ9zGwkfXSAVunOKKA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
