        "author": "SAHIL ALI TONSE",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "9 months ago",
        "comment": "Hosted Valima (Reception event) at this venue and had a great experience. Thanks to Jamal sir and Gracy mam, everything went on as planned. Food, Decoration and all Arrangements were well organised. Would highly recommend this place for events sized 350-500 people.",
