        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "It is situated behind Bangalore East Railway Station on Pottery Road. It's on the main thoroughfare. It's nice to have birthday and wedding events here. The first-story dining hall and the party hall on the ground floor.\nHere, I had biriyani. It was really incredibly good.",
