      {
        "id": "ChIJvwipzq0VrjsRKfF28fsXdEk-rev-0",
        "author": "Debasis Das",
        "rating": 3,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Spacious non-AC function . Thy have good parking space including the parking area of the adjacent church⛪. Located in SG Palyabjust 100 from Banarghatta road. Ideal for marriage and other function. Can easily accommodate 500 people. Can hold different funcions in different floors. The stage and function area is clean and well maintained. The basement parking area need a lot of cleaning,it literally stinks. Overall value for money.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXM3VO3QXI7SHMmOaq_lnv6VGWUVI1M07FWMyGoYxUbtVspUng67A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJvwipzq0VrjsRKfF28fsXdEk-rev-1",
        "author": "Nayaz Pasha",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "11 months ago",
        "comment": "Every thing is good in st Thomas hall except their chairs... main hall very good according to that what they are providing chairs is very cheap there are providing old type plastic chairs in that they are charging for the chairs cover for customer each cover is 10rs how cheap chairs they are giving  compare to other functions hall they are providing very cheap chairs and they are charging above one lakh twenty thousand only for function hall no chairs cover not even sofas... kindly requesting to the st Thomas trust atleast change ur chairs it's look like small function hall chairs.... Except chairs everything is good in that function hall",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrVZsmonpSzvhcqunvFMpcku0pEhHniqWlxEe7mVZYtyRJ-6b3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJvwipzq0VrjsRKfF28fsXdEk-rev-2",
        "author": "Lionel Pinto",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "Good hall . Can accommodate 600 + people. At least 100 parking spaces. Parking lot is not clean. Lift is there . Toilets are not clean..hall is clean and dining area is very spacious. Non AC hall . But good ventilation. Good for engagement and smaller wedding with around 500 crowd. I heard pricing is  reasonable too since it is a community hall and not a corporate business.\n\nRemember to enter via Bannerghatta road and not from taverekere. Taverekere lanes are narrow and nightmare. Very close to Bannerghatta road. Just 100 meters off the main road.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6dV0YYPAaKAhJLHkIHsuz5QPL5DR-fC9KKaIXzCA_X_xIRfPSvg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJvwipzq0VrjsRKfF28fsXdEk-rev-3",
        "author": "Anil Raj (Raj)",
        "rating": 3,
        "date": "7 months ago",
        "comment": "Anold building, with very less maintenance. The aged stage and curtains accumulated a lot of dust. The basement parking stings of food waste and wet mostly. It has enough space to park more than 20 cars.\nThe entrance to this building is just off Bannerghatta road. Try not to take inner roads as it is too narrow and always congested. It's a budget venue for any function.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVdG4R_1VvA3LaDpuBsViMbOb3RgF1tLgl6IEkl5GYw9PTrmTs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJvwipzq0VrjsRKfF28fsXdEk-rev-4",
        "author": "Rob_dez",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "5 years ago",
        "comment": "We attended an wedding here. while visiting hall. This facility has self-sufficient infrastructure of buildings, play ground, parking, generator for weddings, family reunions, art shows. Staff is very helpful and always accomodating. They few greenroom. Clean facilities. They also have balcony or viewing area. Nicely done. There is a huge cooking area. There good number of PG and hotels around to accommodate guest.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUTqqDJZCIORx6hdRqfCqDqUPD2L9jPOpCYQ7esekBnmr1ruFc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
