        "author": "KRSK",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "Nice convention hall for small functions. Neat and clean, very well maintained. Basement has dining hall, 1st and 2nd floor halls. Parking may be a problem I think only road side parking available. Food served here is tasty, quantity also sufficient.\nIt's close to South End Metro Station.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsJoaIwzx5Buf-ABn1InX11MGjiwPPwdLLWI8ORtPsh72Am3M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
