        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "We had arranged an religious family event at Golden Pearl, Banquet Hall on 14-Jan-24. Mr. Pradeep Krishna who is in-charge of this hall did a excellent job. He was at the top of the communication, and arrangements. I mean he was excellent at his roles & responsibilities. He managed the facility well on time and ensured that everything including food, audio arrangements, decorations, lighting, AC's, stage etc.. were ready on time. The food is very good. All the dishes which were ordered tasted excellent, fresh, and the quantity was good. All my relatives and friends appreciated the way it was managed.\n\nIn short, Mr. Pradeep's efforts made my program to meet with a very grand success. Great going.",
