        "author": "syed Azi",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "CMA Royal Convention Hall is an excellent venue for weddings, receptions, and corporate events. The hall is spacious and beautifully decorated, creating a grand and elegant atmosphere. They have comfortable sofas and the whole place is very neat, hygienic, and beautiful. The staff is professional and attentive, ensuring that every detail is taken care of. The catering service is top-notch, with a wide variety of delicious food options. The hall also has ample parking space, which is a big plus. Overall, CMA Royal Convention Hall is a fantastic choice for any special occasion. Highly recommended for any events",
