        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "CMA Royal Convention Hall is an excellent venue for weddings and family functions. The hall is spacious, beautifully maintained, and has elegant interiors that create a grand atmosphere. The staff are courteous and supportive, ensuring everything runs smoothly. The dining area is clean and well organized, and the ample parking makes it convenient for guests. Overall, it offers a wonderful experience with great facilities and is highly recommended for anyone looking for a beautiful and well-managed event venue.",
