        "id": "ChIJzeHjtXgWrjsRK7MwJrWG17k-rev-1",
        "author": "Anuradha Bhattacharjee",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "It was someone's birthday and the event was beautifully curated and carried out. Great food and drinks, served by a very courteous and  well trained staff !\nIt's a members only place.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLaYfuFLC9r2zNRnjJsEakzviSvn7a4-zP7jK4KMBjzTqwiug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
