    "reviews": [
      {
        "id": "ChIJFel_Bng9rjsRkk7A6AIZlyc-rev-0",
        "author": "Veeresh Dollar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Very good hallThe flower decoration was absolutely beautiful, especially the rose arrangements. The decoration team starts work early in the morning to source fresh flowers and works with great dedication and professionalism.\n\nThey offer a wide variety of decoration styles, including traditional wedding décor, Western-themed décor, elegant entrance decorations, special flower garlands, and loose flower arrangements. I was impressed to know that they source premium roses from Chikkaballapur and fresh mallige (jasmine) flowers from Mysore to ensure the best quality.\n\nTheir attention to detail and commitment to making every wedding special is truly commendable. Great job by the entire team! Highly recommended.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXy9q4rpKcseNMQdRsLdHofRuCcWWeaCe2TSnP_1Jy6TPdtNMr8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJFel_Bng9rjsRkk7A6AIZlyc-rev-1",
        "author": "Mahabaleshwara Herle",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "A truly wonderful dining experience! Gassagese Payasam, Puri, pineapple, and Anna Sambar were all excellent. They have valet parking service in the hall. Both the hall and dining hall are centrally air-conditioned, making the environment very cool and comfortable.\n\nThe hospitality was exceptional, and the staff made us feel welcomed throughout.\n\nA very special place with excellent food, warm hospitality, and unforgettable flavors. Highly recommended!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdBCeYPcP9Us0NxdGkpYaHaeWK4Zo2BbTeIB6vcHWfwfFY3w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJFel_Bng9rjsRkk7A6AIZlyc-rev-2",
        "author": "Raghavendra m halthoor",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "A truly wonderful dining experience! The Gassagase Payasam, Puri, Pineapple, Anna Rashmi, and Anna Sambar were all excellent. Every dish was delicious, fresh, and prepared using high-quality ingredients.\n\nOne of the most special aspects is that all the food is first offered to the Lord in the kitchen, which adds a spiritual touch to the dining experience. The staff serve with great care, love, and affection. They are neatly dressed in white shirts and white pants, reflecting cleanliness, discipline, and professionalism.\n\nThe hospitality was exceptional, and everyone was courteous and welcoming. They also provide valet parking, and both the hall and dining hall are centrally air-conditioned, making the atmosphere comfortable and pleasant.\n\nA truly special place with excellent food, outstanding service, and a spiritually uplifting atmosphere. Highly recommended!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJc1jk9eLPJWPUKKbXiiPTSgON19FVA2JhYz9MPmTY5leRiyA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJFel_Bng9rjsRkk7A6AIZlyc-rev-3",
        "author": "Sathyanarayana",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "The food was excellent, fresh, and full of authentic flavors. What impressed us the most was the team's care and attention to every guest. We had a few priests with us, and the staff thoughtfully arranged separate traditional seating on the floor for them. They served them with great respect, love, and devotion, ensuring they were comfortable throughout the meal.\n\nThe hospitality was truly exceptional. Every member of the team was courteous, humble, and dedicated to providing a memorable dining experience. Their warmth, professionalism, and genuine care made the occasion even more special.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for delicious food, heartfelt hospitality, and traditional service with respect and devotion.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIGlK3xnKsjQvJQxycjopk8S2dwHyyDCbdPVqEMpTnCrF-BQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJFel_Bng9rjsRkk7A6AIZlyc-rev-4",
        "author": "Ashokkumar Ashokkumar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "I had a wonderful experience at ISKCON Kalyan Mantap. The venue has an excellent security system with 24-hour security, making guests feel safe and comfortable throughout the event.\n\nThey offer ample parking for around 360 vehicles, which is very convenient for large gatherings. The guest house has 80 well-maintained rooms and is open 24 hours, making check-in and stay hassle-free. There is also 24-hour water supply, ensuring a comfortable experience for all guests.\n\nThe facilities are well managed, and the entire team is courteous and supportive. I highly recommend ISKCON Kalyan Mantap for weddings and all kinds of special occasions.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKM3It-MkS773wM5viHKcVhg_8LBGUOyKvk2WHLMtkdvwj_Dg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
    ]
