        "author": "Jones Joseph",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "8 months ago",
        "comment": "We attended a wedding and reception here on Christmas Eve. The venue is a bit hidden away from the road and it is only after entering the gate that you come to the driveway and get a view of the imposing elevation and building.\nThere is a large hall with seating on the ground floor and then the elevator will take you to the second and third floor with access to the balcony amphitheatre type seating.\nIt is very spacious and has ample seating. The ground floor has ball room type seating with round tables.\nIt then opens up to the beautifully landscapes lawns and grounds that can accommodate the guests and dais.\nThe only issue is the connectivity to rest of the city. Location of Yelahanka can be quite inconvenient for those coming from Indiranagar and beyond.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJOIx9XyH7dRvRvba7KspzeR8z1CujxetisKmD5aOeaxuuJN2-Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
