        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "The Mantapa is small relatively, but the open space is very nice, well maintained and vast enough to host a mid-crowded wedding/event. There are enough open space to set up a buffet and all. The facility is well maintained and neat. I have also heard that this place is a bit economical as well when compared with other wedding halls around.",
