        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "This place probably attracts the largest crowd during durga puja. This place is among the few places that can give you the real durga puja vibes in Bangalore. Amazing  food stalls, jewelleries, show pieces. Live music  is performed here which is amazingly energetic.",
