        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "Durga Puja Pandal was just awesome.\nAuditorium has balcony and backstage can be used as dining during events.\nParking slots place is spacious. maintained very well & clean\nfor function and events overall it's an amazing place & perfect location.. !!",
