        "comment": "Well maintained affordable auditorium cum function hall for official, cultural, felicitation and educational events. Restrooms maintained well with good fittings having sensor based flushers✌️. There is decent enough basement parking 🚗, lights, sound and access is very comfortable includding sitting chairs. From basement to auditorium enterence is very convenient through lift, for elders it is very helpful. I attended here for an Allen online event, for the decent crowd excellent place with moderate space in that locality.",
