        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Very beautiful wedding venue amidst enchanting nature. One will feel out of world in this concrete jungle. Well maintained and serene atmosphere",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUI0U09ugU96p8u4O5rIVgKANFRa4dGixZcCWzasA4gCY9Cu_Rhjg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
