        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "Beautiful hall, ideal for marriages and other functions.\nAmple parking space is available.\nAdded attraction is Beautifuly maintained  mango and jackfruit trees.\nLocation wis3 very near to JP Nagar metro station",
