        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "It's well maintained, Good service, and manageable 250 people very limited parking in seller and street parking is luckily available",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUX7z8oKnseJ-sAPaVwqfYOQp1yTnZ8ZvBcVkA5QpzXo67iuQ4n_A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
