        "comment": "Beautiful and spacious wedding hall in bangalore. Located on Bannerghatta main road next to Christ college. This place has two halls one is suryodaya and other chandrodaya adjacent to each other in the same space. Large space with spacious parking facility but the road taken to take left is quite small. This hall is really spacious and could easily accommodate around 750 people and has a separate dining downstairs which could accommodate the same number. The only negative which I found was the interior lights seemed to be very dull, they could install shite light instead of dimmer ones or you could go with more number of warmer lights instead.",
