        "author": "Shagufta H",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "Nice & new party hall. To host medium sized capcity people. Has a basement parking & well new maintained. On main road in tilak nagar , jayanagar just opposite to Sanjay Gandhi hospital. Resonable too.",
