        "author": "Smitha Leela",
        "rating": 1,
        "date": "7 years ago",
        "comment": "We had booked them for my son’s first birthday party. Pathetic experience I must say. The hall decoration was not done as per what was agreed or shown in the picture at the time of booking. Never ever book your photography with them. He was not even a professional photographer and anyone could have clicked much better pictures than him. Very disappointed with the whole service.\nLuckily we did not book the food and venue through them. So that part went well.",
