        "author": "nagaveni b k",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "9 years ago",
        "comment": "I wanted to throw a party for my little sister. She loves Disney \"Frozen\" movie and so I wanted the decoration theme to match it. We all had fun and good time as everything was ready on time. ShowMyHall helped in showing me the right party hall and also provided a funny decorator. Good Job guys! One suggestion : Get a gift store so that we can have personalized gift options for the birthday girl.",
