        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "One of the good convention centre which I came across in recent times.\nGot very good car parking, in case the parking is full, one can park at the ground near to conventional hall.\nIt’s best suited for large gatherings. Very spacious convention hall.\nThere are separate rooms available for specific needs. Overall very good conventional hall.",
