        "id": "ChIJz5mQu3gVrjsRKItVXUmEhOs-rev-1",
        "author": "Richard Jones",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 years ago",
        "comment": "Good place for a wedding or any other family function.\n\nHad been there for a wedding and liked the hall, though slightly compact it was fully functional and well planned. As it was new it looked fresh and bright as well.\n\nThe hall is air conditioned so adds to a good ambience and comfort level. The interiors of the hall and the lighting is done very well.\n\nParking is planned well in the basement but not too many cars can be parked.\n\nThe dining area is good and spacious.\n\nA nice place for weddings but for a average crowd.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU9d0xINVgHXnzyCT_h1PdJWzItvdSVrVzdGf_JlD4ss0etxcIesQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
