        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "Top Palace Hall, HSR Layout, Bangalore, is an ideal place for people who want to keep their wedding a simple affair. It is a simple yet elegant venue. If you are planning to host a classy wedding, you know where to head. It has multiple party areas from which you can select the desired space for your function. Recommended for pre-wedding functions, grand weddings, and receptions, hosting an event here will make it memorable. This banquet can easily accommodate over a thousand invitees for your big day.\nTop Palace Hall, Bangalore, has flexible slots on offer, where you can choose the timing that suits best for your function. The venue offers decorators to adorn your spaces. You are also free to get your own decorators and have the set-up you wish for. The staff is welcoming and warm. The in-house chefs at the banquet curate scrumptious vegetarian and non-vegetarian delicacies to satiate your guests. So what are you waiting for? Book Top Palace Hall, HSR Layout, Bangalore, for your upcoming events.",
