        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "We booked the venue for my wife’s baby shower and it was great choice. We were very happy with everything in the venue. The entire property was neat and clean and rooms were tidy. Decor was fantastic and a great job by Likitha Lokesh in putting everything together and coordinating.\nThank you for making our event a memorable one.",
