        "comment": "Pretty large Hall with spacious parking. They have a huge separate space for serving food. Decorations were pretty good looking.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXmYlCihSNmF66u0CbvBNa4Tdz9We0s-5BwwjeajOwfTnUSzoFn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
