        "rating": 4,
        "date": "9 months ago",
        "comment": "Recently visited the Whitehall for a function celebration\nThe hall is located 200 meters from the main road little difficult is find.\nThe hall is suitable for 500-800 people and for small functions.\nThe parking is sufficient\nThe hall is well maintained\nThis hall is suitable for Engagement Birthday celebrations naming ceremony etc",
