        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Attended One of my friend's wedding last week. Had an amazing time with clean and neat ambience.\n\nThe reception was excellent has it had a large hall which made the function look very grand.\nThere was plenty of car parking with security to help us park without any issues.\n\nThe dinning area was separate which helped in cleanliness and was well maintained.\n\nRestrooms was clean and wheelchair accessible.\n\nOverall the convention hall was well designed and staff organised the event beautifully. Will give the event a full 💯%",
