        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "One of the best wedding venues for any kind of functions.\nHave huge parking space which can accommodate more than 300 cars and n number of bikes\n\nThe ambience is very neat and clean with well trained staff.  They help you through out the event to give you the best possible experience.\n\nDinning area has a huge capacity so that no one waits and well maintained.",
