        "author": "harish h",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Very beautiful wedding hall, having all facilities.\nSpacious parking available with clean and neat ambience\nWe maintained location with ample dinning area to accommodate huge crowds.\nCreated the best wedding memories with the amazing in house team of decorators.\n\nHighly recommend this location for all functions.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWuTWebkZxy1SdfI5H_rDJfbYOSdET_F9KmQQb0GEuf7ybSsd6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
