        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "I have recently visited MMB convention hall and was highly impressed with the venue.\nIt offers spacious parking area that easily accommodates both bike and car parking, ensuring convenience for guests.\nThe venue also provides great spots and well maintained surroundings.\nThe dinning area is well organized, providing comfortable space for enjoying meals.\n\nOverall this venue is versatile and well equipped venue for all occasions. Offering ample facilities and a pleasant experience for all people who visit the place.",
