        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "Visited PSR Convention Centre, Taarini Garden for a wedding and had a very good experience overall.\nThe venue looked spacious, well maintained, and beautifully set up for a big celebration. The garden and convention space gave a pleasant feel, and the overall ambience was elegant and suitable for weddings and family functions. The seating and guest arrangements were handled well, and the place seemed convenient for hosting large gatherings. Public listings also describe it as a venue with generous capacity, parking, and accommodation options, which makes it practical for wedding events.",
