        "rating": 3,
        "date": "7 years ago",
        "comment": "Good renovation done.. Bit difficulty on parking 4 wheelers. If catering service staff must improve. No ac rooms in d house not fans only a gaint fan cum exhaust are kept on both the side. Plz don't recommend for huge crowd but for limited  people it's d perfect fit.  Good & wounderful choice.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5vcYasxt96rElHPBtIqUcVlFf2VgQraw3EWMcWpeAn-mXWYfU1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
