        "author": "MANSOOR PASHA",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "I recently attended an event at the Marhaba Palace Convention Hall and had a remarkable experience. The venue was spacious and well-equipped to accommodate a large gathering. The layout of the hall was convenient, with ample seating and a stage visible from every angle.\n\nThe staff at the Marhaba palace were extremely professional and helpful, making sure that all of our needs were met and that the event ran smoothly. The facilities were clean and well-maintained, creating a comfortable atmosphere for attendees.\n\nThe audio-visual equipment at the Convention Hall was top-notch, ensuring that presentations and performances were of high quality and easily accessible to all attendees. The catering services provided were also excellent, with a variety of delicious food options to choose from.\n\nOverall, I would highly recommend the Convention Hall for any event or gathering. The venue's exceptional services and facilities make it a fantastic choice for a successful and memorable event.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWti3sP3kQQ8e6tgdyTx-7YT6PW543pHg0trsCBN8x8S5Wua1O=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7",
