        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "If you are looking for a party hall near RT Nagar hebbal area, without second thoughts you can go here. I have never experienced such an accommodating and friendly service for an event. Special mention to Surya- He is a gem who accommodated all our requests and gave his inputs as well and well within our budget. They do not oversell or make you feel forced to get anything additional done. They will adhere to all your requests with patience.\nWe celebrated my mom's birthday and everyone was very happy and satisfied with the event. Food was good, ambience perfect, spacious and holds 150-200 ppl easily. Good for a smaller size event too. If you want to host an event hassle free, highly suggest Tarunn hall.",
