        "author": "Mithilesh.N. Kumar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "7 months ago",
        "comment": "We had a Seemantha ceremony organised at SGS banquets and lawns.  The hall is spacious, clean, and beautifully maintained, making it perfect for family functions and celebrations. The staff were polite, professional, and very supportive throughout the event. Especially Mr. Santhosh and Mr. Sridhar were supportive to make our event most successful. Parking facilities were convenient, and the overall ambience created a great impression for our guests. Food was delicious treat and we were advised best menu choice. Guests loved the food taste and quality. Everything was well-organized and hassle-free. I highly recommended this place for family functions.",
