        "author": "Arundhati Shankar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "7 months ago",
        "comment": "Simple and clean function hall. It's a bit small for big functions but other ceremonies like seemantha, upanayana, engagement etc can be held here. Toilets are clean. The dining hall is almost the same size as that of the function hall. Parking space is also a bit less due to the lawn area.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVna6wsM3TdglJgiM2NtpUHJKIvS05AcigXpdO7RZZYX0Vah7EC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
