        "author": "Harsha Rao",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Small hall for small parties. Great lawn area. Good place for Homa. Only complaint is rest rooms. Too few. Just 2-3 for hundreds of people is not ideal.",
