        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "The area is well reachable both during daytime and also at midnight by private cabs.\n\nVery good outside lawn and very clean eating space and hall.\n\nLight is little less inside eating space I felt\n\nThe hall is not enough to accomodate huge crowd of max 500 people at one shot.\n\nLawn is very wellaintained..this could be a  good place for buffet eating and open dining.\n\nParking area is descent but may not be enough for more than many cars.\n\nThe stage space is small compared to other halls but descent for small gatherings and birthday parties having 1000 people max but in tranches since the space is small.",
