        "date": "5 years ago",
        "comment": "The venue is brilliant looking. Very clean and well maintained and suitable for any event. Very spacious and new-age. The owners are very professional and help you plan your event to the detail. If you are looking for a good ambience and a pretty venue this is it. We had a great time here!",
