        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Visited for marriage function of my relatives in may\nLocation:\nCan be easily located\nHave to follow straight road from RT nagar\nFunction hall is located on ground floor\nWheelchair entrance:\nWheelchair accessibility ✅️✅️✅️\nSeating capacity:\nCould possibly include upto 500+ people\nCatering facility available\nHowever the floral decoration arrangements from outside are not allowed here\nThat seemed odd\nDining:\nDining section separately for ladies and gents\nOverall  good place for functions",
