      {
        "id": "ChIJc5-3N54ZrjsRbrrRVLZQRAc-rev-0",
        "author": "sunil",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "A beautiful wedding destination with a spectacular backdrop. The lavish decorations and lighting setup were perfect for photography. The ambiance of the hall is regal and very well-maintained.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7bZ-BSozKyT-1mPCELRJDhIEyj8jYuFvcAyxIxC0npxigI0rg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJc5-3N54ZrjsRbrrRVLZQRAc-rev-1",
        "author": "Priyanka Devanand Bobade",
        "rating": 2,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "Rating will range from 2.5 to 3. This is also only because of the staff and their kindness (lady staff). There is ample space for parking and rooms are all good. But the owner was forcing us to vacate 1 hour early, and informed just one day before the wedding. This, kind of shocked us all. This was just because there is another wedding who is paying comparatively slightly more than us. This money mindset of the owner upsetted me and my parents. Better to get timings clarified before booking. Apart from that the facility is good.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKiUd5u6Kyk1dL4-xhp1yLlUQEdpRvZW7RXW_UPyrzVIZBqBg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJc5-3N54ZrjsRbrrRVLZQRAc-rev-2",
        "author": "sonia Patrick",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "We recently had our wedding at White Pearl Convention Hall, and it was truly a wonderful experience. Everything was perfectly arranged, and the entire venue looked beautiful for our special day. The hall is spacious, well-maintained, and ideal for weddings and large gatherings.\n\nThe staff were very supportive and cooperative throughout the event, making sure everything ran smoothly. From the decorations to the facilities, everything was well managed and organized. Our guests were also very impressed with the venue and the overall ambiance.\n\nWe are extremely happy that we chose White Pearl Convention Hall for our wedding. It made our special day even more memorable. Highly recommended for anyone planning a wedding or a big celebration!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0vX64ZE_V9fdGuvm85RMjAwrt25DJZWPIAUlYr9NFpG9Yaov0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJc5-3N54ZrjsRbrrRVLZQRAc-rev-3",
        "author": "Vivek Barnwal",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Detailed Reader's Review:\nDurga Puja 2024 – A Memorable Celebration with Great Arrangements!\n\n⭐️ Event Setup: 5/5\n⭐️ Durga Maa Idol: 5/5\n⭐️ Food Stalls: 4/5\n⭐️ Parking: 4/5\n⭐️ Overall: 4.5/5\n\nThis year’s Durga Puja celebration was filled with joy, color, and amazing arrangements. Whether you're here for the festive dandiya nights or just to admire the beautifully crafted Durga Maa murti, you won't be disappointed. Here’s a breakdown of my experience:\n\nEvent Setup & Decor 🎉\n\nThe whole setup was fantastic! The Durga Maa idol looked so cute and divine. The hall arrangements were well-organized, providing a great atmosphere for the celebrations. They've really outdone themselves with the decorations this year!\n\nEvent Setup Rating: 5/5\nDurga Maa Idol Rating: 5/5\nFood & Dandiya Fun 🕺🍴\n\nThe dandiya night was an absolute highlight! For just ₹299, you get entry, food, and dandiya sticks—and it was totally worth it! The fun vibes, music, and energetic atmosphere made it a night to remember. As for the food stalls outside, there were plenty of options to choose from. The food tasted great, though the prices were a bit on the higher side. But hey, it’s festival time!\n\nDandiya Night Rating: 5/5\nFood Stalls Rating: 4/5\nParking & Location 🚗\n\nThere’s ample parking available, but it's paid. However, if you're on a bike, you can find free spots nearby. The only downside is that this year's venue is slightly farther from last year's more central location near Bhartiya City Mall. But it’s worth the trip! Just be mindful of the traffic, especially with the airport route being nearby.\n\nParking Rating: 4/5\nLocation Rating: 4/5\nPro Tips:\n\nTry to arrive early to avoid parking hassles.\nThe food stalls are a bit pricey, but they offer a wide variety of snacks worth trying.\nIf you're heading to the venue, consider using the airport tollway to bypass heavy traffic at junctions.\nOverall Verdict:\nA well-organized Durga Puja celebration filled with festive energy, great food, and a memorable dandiya night. Despite the slightly farther location, it’s a must-visit if you’re in the area. Jai Maa Durga! 🙏",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV00J9XYMvWj8P0xQF1SeZ4U4EUAzUE3mequf2DuANXHnWnZ7VnqQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJc5-3N54ZrjsRbrrRVLZQRAc-rev-4",
        "author": "D.M SULAIMAN",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "Huge space that works well for big weddings, receptions, and corporate events\nElegant interiors with chandelier-heavy “royal wedding” aesthetics\nSpacious parking, which in Bengaluru traffic-land is practically a superpower\nMany reviews praise the staff coordination during large functions\nGood lighting and stage setup for photography/video shoots",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-Uax5S8V3zWz4LAhfc2PFbim9N2rVgDgmiegnHt1CaCt6ejEG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
