        "comment": "Had an amazing experience at Vishnu Veer Banquet & Wedding Venue! The venue is spacious, beautifully maintained, and perfect for weddings and special events. The staff was professional, friendly, and very attentive to every detail, ensuring everything ran smoothly. The decorations, ambiance, and overall arrangements exceeded expectations. Guests were impressed with the excellent service and comfortable facilities. Highly recommend this venue to anyone looking for a memorable and stress-free event experience. Thank you for making the occasion so special! 🎉💐✨",
