        "author": "gowtham j",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "We had an amazing experience at this venue for a Naming ceremony. The location was beautiful, well-maintained, and created the perfect atmosphere for our special day. The staff was professional, friendly, and attentive throughout the planning process and the event itself.\nThe venue offered excellent facilities, ample space for our guests, and stunning décor that required very little additional setup. Everything was organized smoothly, and the team went above and beyond to ensure that every detail was taken care of.\nOur guests were impressed with the ambiance, service, and overall experience. We couldn't have asked for a better place to celebrate such an important occasion. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a memorable venue.",
