        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "A spacious, well-maintained, and air-conditioned venue praised for its supportive staff and good hospitality.The hall is beautifully maintained, spacious, and well-lit, making for gorgeous photos. There was also ample parking for everyone. I highly recommend this venue to anyone looking for a stress-free and elegant event.",
