        "comment": "Fantastic Kendra with wast space and different halls for our needs. Opt place for conducting a beautiful functions like marriage, dance ,music, company get-togethers etc. The main entrance has abog auditorium. Capacity of more than 500. The stage is too spacious to conduct any programme. Complete air-conditioning with focus lights and stage lights.                                            There is a balcony which is also having lights focusing the stage. There is a medium hall of about  250 to 300 with a stage on th right side where marriage and other medium size functions can be conducted.\nThe dining hall is little below the ground level having capacity of around 250.\nAll these in a Mahal type building which represents old palaces.\nWorthy place for grand functions.",
