        "id": "ChIJS2Xd4E4XrjsRbt3mLOa3ZnM-rev-3",
        "author": "Azhar Baig",
        "rating": 1,
        "date": "7 months ago",
        "comment": "It is very small hall one should stick to 100 members only . The big problem is you should be very strict and precise about the catering as the food gets delayed how much in the sense mean for almost 2 hrs as they will come late and to shift the item in the lift will take overall 30 minutes in between other people will also use it after that the Helpers will setup the table 10 to 15 minutes gone to keep the plate to place the roll and put sweet cups if they do bit slow another 10 minutes gone. It is better to prepare there upstairs or don't book the Hall at all. It is better to skip this hall",
