        "author": "Gokul kishan",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "Had been for a party, good hall for 200 people, had plenty of space. The washroom were okish. Good Ac hall.\nOnly down side is the parking space, very difficult to find space to park cars. Good for bikes.\nIt has lift.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-UjNuWFQoS-UV7V_DK8yzWgGpD-EFNwS_Kp3ymGuc6ZErINfBjg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
