        "id": "ChIJS2JeKN8XrjsRWoBBEVC98Cc-rev-0",
        "author": "F D",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "Pretty decent place with good decor and seats around 100 pax comfortably.\nThe AC needs to be pepped up during these hot days. Hall in 2nd floor & dining hall on 3rd floor. Parking on one side of the street only.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkwe5b6pzQag_VNK7namyfSZwAr9F23bTNXTJtvdhROmXHLnEX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
