        "comment": "It's not so big venue but OK for party or function of 500 people capacity,\ncons : 1)very dirty rest room\n2) no parking space we have park on main road\n3) dinning area is of only 100 people capacity.\n4) no air ventilation in dinning area.\n5)  no maintenance of hall by the management old paint and chairs",
