        "date": "7 years ago",
        "comment": "Badly maintained marriage or a reception hall. Just the entrance looks enticing. You will not recommend this place to anyone if you use the restroom and the staircase to get to the first floor. They both are dirty and will speak volumes about the place's maintenance. This hall can accommodate not more than 100 people at once.\n\nThe only advantage this place boasts of is that it is situated on the main road. Parking could be a difficult afffair as there is no dedicated area. You might end up parking on the side of the road. Good luck!",
