        "author": "Nayana Ramesh",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "8 months ago",
        "comment": "Perfect space for an outdoor wedding or any intimate wedding, sheltered by massive trees. It has a mandap, restrooms nearby and also the glass roofed space for setting up the buffet. Also has ample parking space, an unisex salon, a cafe and other amenities for outstation guests. Away from the city but worth conducting an intimate event.",
