        "author": "BADRINATH KOWLIGI",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "10 months ago",
        "comment": "This is a nice resort like marriage hall with open centre and about 10/15 rooms . Situated off the airport road to the right on Kogilu cross road ..\ngood for about 200/250 gathering and has good parking options ..",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUbz3F_mDJb8aYQyI41sgfGy3Gn7xkR7DEm-Ose3ymF_i0a8EP-DQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
