        "author": "Mitula K",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "The venue for my sister's wedding was absolutely stunning, and the event management crew truly outdid themselves! Everything was handled perfectly, exceeding our expectations and bringing our vision to life. Even with some last-minute requests, the team, especially Sujit and Arshil, coordinated everything seamlessly. A huge shoutout to them for making our day so incredibly special! Plus, the rooms were very well maintained, which was a lovely bonus. Thank you!!!!",
