        "author": "From Memory Studios",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "11 months ago",
        "comment": "We photographed a wedding here and must say… it’s a hidden gem among wedding venues to work at. Ultra professional team, and everything is well maintained. Highly recommend! IG @frommemory.studios",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_7ECNh-AyvFgq85aJZgKiS1oALv2ukWiWYmRR1Vezvlh68A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
