        "author": "Ananth Rao H",
        "rating": 2,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Apart from being a new concept, the venue doesn't have anything special in it.\n\nThe open marriage mantap inside kalyani is unique but people found it extremely difficult in hot sunlight.  A hard canopy on top would be better.\n\nToilets weren't clean and cleaning wasn't down correctly",
