        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 years ago",
        "comment": "Very spacious ,lush green open space with well planned places like pond, Mandapam, sitting area, Dining hall, rooms for both parties. Ample vehicles parking space .It is in a remote but well connected road. It was like a picnic day.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUO3Vrk7mGfTn3JsI8khRHaUgKM74dP1tbpdhlcly5OTRliW8YjAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
