        "id": "ChIJt1-QaHsZrjsRPn2loleXeVs-rev-1",
        "author": "Neha Vl",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "We had our reception at Antra, Bangalore. It is a beautiful place with beautiful people managing it (Deepak, Gowthami). Everyone is so friendly and thoughtful and ready to help out whenever necessary. The location is super pretty during the day and looks amazing with the lights at night. We had a guitarist and bonfire following our reception which was an awesome experience! The rooms are like a 5 star hotel and the whole area is kept very clean by the staff! Would highly recommend Antra, happy retreats and the entire team to anyone having a wedding celebration in Bangalore!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrhG23VSvhgIh81lXQk-aeF2kUB1MTPZb15tzZ5MO0ia5McmTgOQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
