        "author": "umesh raman",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "Had a wonderful experience celebrating my family. My second son 10th birthday at Cini World azure theatre. The arrangements, decoration, and overall ambience were really nice and well organized. The staff was very supportive and made the celebration special for our son . Everything was managed perfectly and we truly enjoyed the moment. Thank you for making the day memorable for us.thank you cini world.",
