        "rating": 5,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "Had a wonderful experience celebrating my parents’ 25th anniversary at Cini World. The arrangements, decoration, and overall ambience were really nice and well organized. The staff was very supportive and made the celebration special for our family. Everything was managed perfectly and we truly enjoyed the moment. Thank you for making the day memorable for us",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTjVavJGesMj1Y6462n4QNQIDFbI3A7wPqUzWVVf1Rr8xJKw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
