        "rating": 4,
        "date": "7 months ago",
        "comment": "Good location. Far away from mad bengaluru city crowd and polution. Big 4 or 8 way roads are coming up in the area.\nMore hygienic toilets, hand wash facilities are to be provided. Hand Washing basins were over flowing within minutes of use.\nAttended friend's son's marriage. Area is very big. Plenty of cars and two wheelers can be parked.\nWill review fully when I visit next time.",
