    "reviews": [
      {
        "id": "ChIJ8c4WftsjrjsRR_r5lvmAZKI-rev-0",
        "author": "Aravindh Ramesh",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "This was our wedding venue, located near Airport. It has 24 spacious rooms, 5 people can easily stay in a room with additional mattresses. The package includes decor as well and it was extremely well decorated and magnificent. It looked straight out of a movie and our guests couldn't stop appreciating it. We even got complementary oonjal decor electricity which looked extremely beautiful. We had a 1.5 days event and the staffs were very helpful too. There is an open semi covered lawn which can host small events like Haldi, Mehendi etc. There is an open covered space which can host events like engagement and even marriages of the capacity is less. And then there is a huge open lawn which can host marriages and receptions for 500-800 people. I did extensive research on the venues in Bangalore and it's costs, found this to be very reasonable for the offerings. Everything from rent, decor, electricity, backup, tables and chairs were included. Ram (owner) was extremely kind and helped us with all the requirements. Thank you, Ram., we have recommended the venue to our guests and friends. I visited more than 20 -25 venues for my brother's wedding last year unfortunately couldn't come across Chitrakoot . I feel blessed to have come across them for my wedding and chose them for my big day.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVAvdEKcWKwc8DSgIm3TF6Wv-GI156_u-zV3O-N7Acz7dQhDdHS6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ8c4WftsjrjsRR_r5lvmAZKI-rev-1",
        "author": "kiran kumar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "Our wedding at Chitrakoot Wedding Venue, Singanayakanahalli, was nothing short of magical! The lush greenery and open spaces gave us the perfect backdrop for our celebrations. We loved how the décor could be customized to match our royal and traditional theme. The staff went above and beyond to make sure everything ran smoothly, and our guests felt comfortable throughout. From Haldi to Muhurtham, every moment felt special thanks to the venue’s ambiance. Truly a place that made our big day unforgettable!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRf2xvoiwPTGU1TSgM5dYw7jt-toTGwNItjCqCRhZS4V9KJs4B=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ8c4WftsjrjsRR_r5lvmAZKI-rev-2",
        "author": "Ayush Rajbhar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Absolute perfection! We had an incredible stay at this property. The 24 rooms are remarkably spacious, immaculate, and thoughtfully designed. If you are scouting locations for a wedding, corporate retreat, or large celebration, their expansive event venues are ideal, and the massive car parking area ensures a hassle-free experience for all your guests...",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGoaUfZ0HQvwiwIUNiIB5tK-OQ9RixpyT4Nu64a_6C7ljOKnbv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ8c4WftsjrjsRR_r5lvmAZKI-rev-3",
        "author": "Harish.N Hari",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "The wedding lawn at Chitrakoot Venue is beautiful and very spacious. Our decorations looked even better because of the open layout. The ambience during the evening reception was simply wonderful. All our relatives loved the venue.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXbKichIne5obWVS4PIzSqcHsXDBOSaTu8zV3riWsUZxiSnyVf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ8c4WftsjrjsRR_r5lvmAZKI-rev-4",
        "author": "Upendra S C",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "We celebrated our son’s birthday at this venue, and the ambience was very good. Our guests also appreciated the venue very much.\n\nIt is an excellent place for marriages, birthday celebrations, and other functions. The cost of the venue is also economical and budget-friendly.\n\nRegarding food arrangements, if you choose external caterers, it works well. However, if you wish to prepare food at the venue itself, vessels are not available, so you need to arrange them from outside.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTVBQtPVb_PPyseQ571VnbV-Ky7uR5Xy_0x4SkBSLYmZ-fEg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
    ]
