        "rating": 5,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "We recently had the pleasure of setting up Photobooth at this beautiful venue for a wedding reception, and the experience was fantastic! The space is well-organized, spacious, and perfect for capturing memorable moments 📸✨\nAt Momentize Photo Booth, we loved being part of this celebration—our Photobooth added fun, energy, and instant keepsakes that guests truly enjoyed. If you’re hosting an event here, Momentize Photo Booth is a great addition to elevate the experience and make your memories last forever!",
