        "author": "Sarath Gopal",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "9 months ago",
        "comment": "The resort is spread over a vast area which can accommodate huge crowds. Its one of the best wedding venues available in Bangalore with well maintained garden and premises. Its perfect for both indoor and outdoor events and the parking lot can accommodate more vehicles.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzKtDq0qGTGV_OE-vTZfzmW0l8N9GVMhmeZm-zRIHlCMl2MFlc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
