        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "Suspicious location for a gathering of 2000 to 3000 people. Ample of parking and good ambiance.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeUt1VNNU68z17sl0ePjEj3RvborfB1DanPCWTce3igJWBG3-P=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
