        "comment": "I recently attended a birthday party at Asthitva The Venue, and the experience was excellent. The hall is spacious and can comfortably accommodate around 100 people. The dining area can hold about 50 guests at a time. There is ample parking space available for both bikes and cars.\n\nPlease note: The nearest metro station is Jnanabharathi, which is approximately 6 km away from the venue.",
