        "author": "Shreyas Gowda",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "Absolutely loved the ambience and overall experience at this venue. The space is beautifully maintained, spacious, and perfect for hosting events and celebrations. The arrangements, lighting, cleanliness, and management were all top-notch. The staff was very cooperative and ensured everything went smoothly throughout the event. A great place for weddings, receptions, parties, and family functions. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a premium event venue!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9QuH2AeYizw6Zx9WOvWmr2uyt1_ubpjHeoLmmubsxb2sCkmVC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
