        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "Lovely venue ! The flow of spaced is perfect .. can host birthdays, engagements and receptions .. the AC rooms behind the stage are very good as well. Clean bathrooms. Lots of parking available! Easy access for people with disability because it's all flat surfaces.",
