        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 weeks ago",
        "comment": "We had a wonderful experience celebrating our Seemantha function at this beautiful venue. The ambience was elegant and welcoming, and the spacious setting was perfect for accommodating all our guests comfortably. The facilities were excellent and well-maintained, making the entire event smooth and hassle-free.\n\nThe flower decoration deserves a special mention—it was beautiful, elegant, and added so much charm to the overall setup. Everything was thoughtfully arranged and executed perfectly, making our special day even more memorable. Truly grateful for the wonderful experience and highly recommend this venue for special occasions!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7S2gb1q43s4Anu7SAHeMGAY_A08IXZ_iCrjSgdaCP12zFNQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
