        "author": "Arjun",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "I attended my cousin’s wedding reception here, and the venue is really good. It is filled with greenery and has a big stage with beautiful and elegant decoration. The décor and lighting give the place a very pleasant and classy feel. it’s a great place for weddings and other events in West Bangalore.",
