        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "Shivleela party hall is a great place for conducting any event. Recently I had done my engagement in the party hall. Everything was so perfect from scratch.\nThe decoration was on point. The food was ultimate. The party hall gives the very rich look. Overall it was a nice experience.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUShj6VeXIfapNxTwJJjK19HQNnjQ3TwxDV64Vu329JaJp5dn4c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
