        "rating": 3,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "We recently got married here. The wedding hall is spacious, clean, and worth the money. However, while taking the advance, they mentioned that gas would be free, but on the wedding day they informed us that only four 14 kg gas cylinders were included. Also, the vessels provided were not sufficient for cooking for 1500 people. Because of this inconvenience, I am giving 3 stars.",
