        "author": "Hemanth Kumar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "Naksh infrastructure, we arranged a marriage at this hall. Good marriage hall for crowd upto 1200. Good decorations, Rooms available, lift available, limited parking available.",
