        "id": "ChIJH37j8is9rjsRMcTNoR_mqQc-rev-0",
        "author": "Rajesh V",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "*⭐⭐⭐⭐ ⭐Made our baby shower unforgettable!*\nWe wanted everything to be perfect for our little one’s celebration, actually i was little worried too But *Blossom Banquet Hall* delivered it.\nThe venue was beautiful, Our event was very smooth and flawless - from setup to the last guest, everything was taken care of.\nThank you Blasom team for being part of our special memories 💕\nHighly recommend!",
