        "author": "Ram Kumar",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "It is very spacious...People who want to conduct a marriage or any big sized events , this could be an ideal one for both who live in Bangalore as well as in Mysore .. If you have friends and relatives in both the places and you are concerned about their presence then this should be the best choice 👌.",
