      {
        "id": "ChIJm2KpJyU_rjsR5IsTT_Tjm0w-rev-0",
        "author": "Vinayak Dutt",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "Always love to visit Mysuru palace (inside and as well as outside during weekend lights)\n\nYou can have all the prestigious glimpse and feel of how the kings ruled and the equipment used along with guide when you go inside\n\nSpend your evenings with chats and juice while you ply to see the lights for the palace with a very well decorated tango ride",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8JN9FWOIhkmYNiNMTABMHGAeuc-holr6XGMIQ96Bc5kK0WSJmsA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJm2KpJyU_rjsR5IsTT_Tjm0w-rev-1",
        "author": "Gayathri Sasidharan",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "10 months ago",
        "comment": "The hall is incredibly spacious, grand, and beautifully designed, perfect for large gatherings and memorable celebrations. The elegant interiors, high ceilings, and well-planned layout give every event a regal atmosphere.\n\nThe facilities are well-maintained, and the venue comfortably accommodates significant functions without feeling crowded.\n\nOne thing to remember is that parking can get tight during huge weddings, but it's manageable with a bit of planning.\n\nOverall, Maharaja Palace is a fantastic choice for weddings and special events—stunning ambience, excellent service, and an experience that leaves a lasting impression. Highly recommended!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0ElDpewGVbgYG_HdjHr9Pq9k0AZ6hotQDvudP689aYJrZ_Xq6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJm2KpJyU_rjsR5IsTT_Tjm0w-rev-2",
        "author": "Rakshith",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "An elegant venue with a glamorous ambience and exquisite architecture. The lighting setup is beautifully designed and adds a truly luxurious feel to the atmosphere. If you are looking to host a grand and memorable wedding, this is definitely the perfect place",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6r_TJbdmzGLMLyUyINhsGnYMTwZtyf9bSYXMg3aNm4E5-Zzk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJm2KpJyU_rjsR5IsTT_Tjm0w-rev-3",
        "author": "Madhu Simha",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Nice and Big Hall!\nI went to a wedding at Maharaja Palace in Banashankari and liked it a lot. The place is big, clean, and looks beautiful inside. The stage and decorations were really nice, and there was enough space for all the guests.\n\nThere’s also good parking space, which is helpful. The staff was friendly and managed everything well. Only thing is, a clearer sign outside would help people find the place more easily.\n\nOverall, a very good hall for weddings and other big events.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWiz5-S2JxXGqB67Hu5zB6RqMrQmUwEDOOvmss4xhkTwHAHdZjq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJm2KpJyU_rjsR5IsTT_Tjm0w-rev-4",
        "author": "Nagaraj Bhat",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "I attended a wedding at this venue today and had a very good experience overall. The hall is quite spacious and can comfortably accommodate around 500–600 people, making it ideal for large gatherings and events. The centralized AC system worked efficiently, keeping the entire space cool and pleasant even with a big crowd.\nOne of the major advantages of this place is the huge parking area, which made it very convenient for guests to park without any hassle. The dining hall was also well-maintained and air-conditioned, providing a comfortable environment while having food.\nThe staff were friendly, cooperative, and attentive throughout the event, ensuring everything ran smoothly. Overall, it is a well-equipped and well-managed venue, perfect for weddings and large functions.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlWw9gM9__HSBeeV8KM4vjoiH8_fEuweNwbm--8B5vROIQ5vfAwA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
