        "comment": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nHB Function Hall truly exceeded our expectations. The 200-seater arrangement  and Floting 450 was extremely comfortable, spacious, and thoughtfully organized. The hall was spotlessly clean and very well maintained 😍\n\nWhat touched us the most was the owner’s honesty, kindness, and genuine support. He is a highly trustworthy person who treated our function like his own and ensured everything went smoothly without any stress.🫶\n\nOur event became a beautiful and memorable experience because of the excellent management and warm cooperation. We are truly grateful and would wholeheartedly recommend HB Function Hall to anyone looking for a perfect venue for their special occasions🫰❤️🫰",
