        "author": "SK ROY",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "I recently had the pleasure of attending a wedding ceremony of my office friend at Vishnu Priya Marriage Center, and I must say, it was an amazing experience from start to finish. From the moment I stepped foot into the venue, I was greeted with warm smiles and impeccable service. In terms of space they have a capacity of more than 200 people at 1 go. Speaking of catering, the food was an absolute delight. The menu was diverse and catered to various tastes, with each dish being prepared to perfection. The presentation was exquisite, and the flavors were simply outstanding. The staff efficiently managed the dining area, ensuring that everyone was served promptly and with utmost courtesy. Overall it's a very beautiful and specious property for marriage or any other function.",
