        "id": "ChIJnYhOyVo-rjsRxksfThU2_10-rev-0",
        "author": "madhuri prakash",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "This is a very beautiful wedding hall. It can accommodate around 1000+ people in the hall. The stage is spacious giving it a lot of space for the couple and the guests . The dinning hall is huge. Can accommodate 700 guest in one go . They also have a garden area , you can setup this space for buffet . Car parking is free and well mannered car parking . You will always have e a watchman to help you park the vehicle . Decorations can be done very well because the building is beautiful built. You can have a great entrance . For the mururthan you have als have a centre stage mantap. Over all it’s a beautiful place to get one’s wedding done here",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXuVhrfcI1gU9WkJ-NiCDBCGbQbiAMLJf1bnLr6oGyPf_uvk3j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
