        "rating": 4,
        "date": "8 months ago",
        "comment": "This place  is huge  just started very recently.  Still micr brew is not started.  Excellent place  for weekend. No reservations  required as of now. Enough  space  is there.  Ambience  too good  service  is excellent.  In Food  some  items  need to be fine tuned.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJECY6RL-yJQvOd77Ka2oSuyWbBy-KX24GeUvOvYpbeLnoFGw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
