    "reviews": [
      {
        "id": "ChIJ-ZK0du49rjsRIu_zWzFade0-rev-0",
        "author": "Gururaja SR",
        "rating": 3,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Rajahans Convention Hall is one of the innumerable small scale industrial units along west of Chord road, Bangalore which has been rebuilt into a public function hall. Considerable expense has gone in to give an appearance of luxury with glittering interior, large wooden frames, elevator etc. The main hall is spacious enough to accommodate about 250 to 300 persons. The Dining and kitchen spaces on ground floor complement the facility. I invariably measure these places on as to how well the overall administration and maintenance are by looking at the Rest Rooms. If adequate attention is paid to maintain the rest rooms and toilets with clean and shiny floors and the plumbing is working and free of stains and rust, then entire premises would naturally spic and span, besides one can also expect efficient and devoted maintenance staff. This is where Rajahans is deficient. The Restrooms had floors full stains and taps, cistern etc looked I'll maintained. There is considerable room for improvement. The vacant site adjoining the hall provides parking space for about 20 cars which is huge plus point on the narrow road.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrpGTpAK4S5x1UrQJwRvkUl5e7n0ATJVhfmhgYCcJyaqIorA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ-ZK0du49rjsRIu_zWzFade0-rev-1",
        "author": "Pradeep Cozy",
        "rating": 1,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "I visited this place a few days ago and returned with my family on 20th February around 8 pm to finalize the booking. The main hall and dining hall are spacious and well maintained. It can easily accommodate 1000+ guests, which perfectly matched our requirements. The staff member who showed us the rooms and facilities was very polite and patiently answered all our questions. Overall, everything met our expectations.\nHowever, our experience changed completely when we met the manager in the office. He is an old guy. He behaved very arrogantly and spoke rudely to my family. He was unwilling to have a proper conversation and his tone was extremely disrespectful. It completely spoiled the positive impression we had formed earlier. Because of his behavior, we decided not to proceed with the booking and left the venue.\nIt took us quite some time to recover from the unpleasant experience. Basic courtesy and respect towards customers are very important, especially in the hospitality industry. I hope the owner looks into this matter. I have mentioned the date and time, and the CCTV footage can be checked for verification.\nVery disappointing experience",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLNbz8hta4uQ6kwWp_fgqdJ5Lvt7mcuQgAVVxgUoPboMjrmP9p=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ-ZK0du49rjsRIu_zWzFade0-rev-2",
        "author": "Sunil Prasad",
        "rating": 1,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "I visited this place recently with my family to explore it as a potential venue for our event. The property itself is quite impressive — the halls are spacious, well-maintained, and suitable for accommodating a large number of guests. The overall infrastructure matched our requirements, and initially, we were quite satisfied with what we saw.\n\nThe staff who showed us around were polite and helpful, patiently explaining the facilities and answering our questions. Up until that point, everything felt smooth and professional.\n\nHowever, our experience took a completely different turn when we met the manager in the office. His behavior was extremely disappointing. He came across as arrogant and spoke in a very rude and dismissive manner, especially in front of my family. He showed no willingness to have a proper discussion and his tone lacked basic courtesy.\n\nThis interaction completely ruined the positive impression we had formed earlier. Because of this unpleasant experience, we decided not to proceed with the booking and left the venue.\n\nBasic, respect and professionalism are extremely important. Unfortunately, this was clearly lacking in our case. I hope the management takes this feedback seriously and addresses such behavior.\n\nAll the venues are booked in this area for our dates, now I understand why this hall is still not booked.\n\nVery disappointing experience.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIzG22aB6lMQXVsxv_Vzx4XkSpLkof-Sr6finZg464dvDNHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ-ZK0du49rjsRIu_zWzFade0-rev-3",
        "author": "Varshini S",
        "rating": 1,
        "date": "6 months ago",
        "comment": "We had a terribly disappointing experience with the manager of this venue. He was an older person and he is extremely rude, insulting and condescending.\nOur exact question to the manager was 'can we get a 500 rupees discount on the extra rooms we would pay for?' and his exact response was 'our venue has not stooped to that level yet. If it comes to that level, I will give you a call then, leave your number with me'. This in the rudest tone possible.\n\nThis happened on the day we were ready to make a payment and book the venue.\nWe backed out only because of this behavior. If this is the way the manager speaks to us even before we have made a payment, one can only imagine the behavior of theirs when the booking is done.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxft4oj7I2fAVItbYMKCNYQ_kRjvmhMvOi7edkNEN0ZjpbRV0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJ-ZK0du49rjsRIu_zWzFade0-rev-4",
        "author": "Sandeep Nsk",
        "rating": 3,
        "date": "4 years ago",
        "comment": "Very decent place for all marriage functions. Parking would be little. First comes first serves. Fully hygiene and tidy. Rooms good. Stage spacious. Mantappa Wash rooms could be more tidy. If crowded, dinning hall suffocates. Easily recognisable location. Stays on traffic road. No special gifts shops or gold shops available nearby.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEWyhW8OSx74t40yK-Zqq3u7qu-zr_p_ftWVtChAFaD8cN0s750g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
    ]
