        "date": "7 years ago",
        "comment": "A functional with not so good amenities. It is too interior from Magadi Main Road, the road to reach this place is too narrow too. There are no much parking space available. It has parking space for 10 - 12 cars and if you're lucky, you will find one if you get in early. The drawback  is that if you come early and park, you cannot leave early as cars would be parked behind yours and there is no one manage the car parking. The ambiance  too is not so good, it is not clean. As the road is not good and dusty, the same is spread to the hall.",
