        "rating": 4,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Decent marriage hall which can accommodate around 300 guests. Dining hall in the basement and can accommodate around 200 persons at a time. 17 rooms are there for guests. Lift facility available. Toilet management needs improvement. Parking space for four wheelers is not adequate and road side parking is difficult to get. Easily reachable as it is located on Kothnur main road, RBI layout",
