        "author": "SUBRAMANIAN PALLAVOOR",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "A well appointed marriage hall with good amenities for conducting marriage functions.  The main hall can accommodate easily 400 people and dining hall accommodates around 300 people. There are 15 rooms for staying and rooms are good.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIAjcw2ZZvVzCORhomFzDG9I_NMjumr1knTbscdNP0ZVMMOPg0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7",
