        "date": "4 years ago",
        "comment": "This place is STUPENDOUS!\nRecently I attended an engagement conducted here and I was mind blown by looking at the hall. It can easily accomodate 500 persons at a time. This is an AC hall. The dining hall can serve 150 guests at a time. If you planning to celebrate/host any of your events, choose this place without any second thoughts.",
