        "rating": 3,
        "date": "8 months ago",
        "comment": "A below average function hall to hold small party. This place can handle upto 100 people at once. The facilities are pretty basic. Road side parking makes it more difficult. Ok to host birthday and engagement kind of functions and certainly not for hosting marriages.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXM3VO3QXI7SHMmOaq_lnv6VGWUVI1M07FWMyGoYxUbtVspUng67A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
