        "author": "Swathi Sudhakar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "It was a very nice and spacious convention hall. I attended this hall during the BookChor event and had a great experience. The hall was well-maintained, had good space coverage, and provided a comfortable environment.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMkZnBgk612Xhg6G9k1lr1XOEH_gCmNbXqnGLJ7LqVVFW8o8tr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
