        "rating": 5,
        "date": "5 years ago",
        "comment": "Hosted a reception for our friends in Bangalore at Zaitoon. The banquet hall is really spacious and the staff are extremely courteous and knowledgeable. Every guest loved the food that was arranged as buffet. I would highly recommend Zaitoon to anyone who is planning to host their friends ane family.",
