        "id": "ChIJG2TZb0YVrjsRi045qacjCm8-rev-2",
        "author": "Arbaaz Khan",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Reshmi si good service and food is good thank you so much Reshmi ❤️❤️🥰",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWMljiCTe3YWUO5hVeqauyHCvQc-bBQ8vYRCddK0Ly-bIDxMf1k0g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
