        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Attended a good griends sons wedding recently.   This is a very nice venue quite large with good viewing n dining areas.  High draped ceilings n well appointed stage n musicians/DJ station.  Handwash, toilets, lawn area, car park and complete with Ganesh Temple within the huge premises which also has multiple venues.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDpgQv2mWoepAprIrR58o2txnm07n6z5dsJRoMgB2E62Tal53X=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
