      {
        "id": "ChIJuf1aarAVrjsRDf-hMnxuwY0-rev-0",
        "author": "Narayanan AS",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "a month ago",
        "comment": "It's a very nice compact place for smaller functions. You have an open area where one side is left open and the other side is covered. There is a small room with an AC attached, along with a kitchen for serving. The good thing is it's very compact and neatly done. Good for a small program of 50 or 100 people, it's a very beautiful location. I would definitely recommend this for that.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWAhBJENu0OWFSSk0FuYMFqs5EZqiIACqu-IRDMpc4Nj7blabwm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJuf1aarAVrjsRDf-hMnxuwY0-rev-1",
        "author": "arun nine",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "I celebrate my daughter 1st year birthday!! extraordinary wonderful place for birthday & seemantham small functions!! In jp nagar 4th place peaceful near kalyani magnum main road dollars layout is the location !! The place is easily accessible, beautiful both inside and out, the person in charge helps with finding the people to help with the organizing of different activities, leaves us with a manager and couple of housekeeping to help with keeping the place clean while we have the event going on, a manager to help play the music to mention a few.\nMy event was success, thanks to organizing it here. All guests loved the place and asked about how I came across they place and their pricing etc details.\nThe small waterfall fountain and a mix of both indoors and outdoors gives the right blend to even the claustrophobic people to feel comfortable.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSHFTr_i3bW4VfQOkfGKz3LZzAL9Sm3yrw7liWjG30MLy2gSs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJuf1aarAVrjsRDf-hMnxuwY0-rev-2",
        "author": "achutha vishnu",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Superb place for small events. Lawn and small dining area. Outdoors natural setting in south bangalore.\nOnly thing, owners micromanage a lot of things, very strict on timelines, how many seats allowed etc",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-FGuneYWf-bPNRarnd_KJDZGmNC1fwM6hqqjgwHtr75ipOQ-o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJuf1aarAVrjsRDf-hMnxuwY0-rev-3",
        "author": "Smayan Chatterjee",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "7 months ago",
        "comment": "I recently hosted event here and couldn't be happier. The decor was magical and exactly what I envisioned. A huge thank you to Nishanka for their hard work in making sure everything ran smoothly. All I want to say is that, it was awesome and highly recommend to do events here",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5Jg4eEou3_0cWmZU1_0qLP6EzKLww5fqtacuwe026Kni7BsaI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJuf1aarAVrjsRDf-hMnxuwY0-rev-4",
        "author": "kajal singh",
        "rating": 1,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "₹1,666 per 10 minutes. Let that sink in.\n\nThat’s effectively what we paid when we were charged ₹15,000 for a 1.5-hour extension at the end of our event. Along with that, there were constant staff reminders about wrapping up, which made the atmosphere tense. Not the kind of experience you expect for a celebration.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU9YzK4j3LGefeA9hZF8q1w3Pu1kXt8Um4cVogEnqZrug7CRUQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
