    "reviews": [
      {
        "id": "ChIJTbQHEts_rjsRA06141khfZU-rev-0",
        "author": "Srinivasan Narasimhan",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 months ago",
        "comment": "Helipad! Dining and the spacious Wedding Hall in the ground floor. Some 13 rooms on the first floor. 2 of them are dorms. Breathtaking view of the mantap from Groom and Brides rooms on the first floor. Dream! 11L to 13L for upto 36 hours. All inclusive except gas and cleaning I understand.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWFlSSRS2cizU7t43KgI2uyXKdE14EAH3UXU1nSspjEyfcgfPzghw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJTbQHEts_rjsRA06141khfZU-rev-1",
        "author": "Praveen Kamalakkanavar",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "We recently hosted our daughter's naming ceremony at BRS Grandeur, and it was truly a wonderful experience. The venue is magnificent, with elegant interiors and a beautiful ambiance that made our celebration even more special.\n\nWhat impressed us the most was the exceptional service provided by the entire team. They were professional, courteous, and ensured that every detail was taken care of well in advance. Everything was perfectly organized and ready for the big day, allowing us to enjoy the event without any stress.\n\nThe cleanliness and maintenance of the venue were outstanding, and the staff ensured that the hall remained spotless throughout the function. Their attention to detail and commitment to making our event a success was evident from start to finish.\n\nA heartfelt thank you to the entire BRS Grandeur team for making our daughter's naming ceremony a memorable occasion. I would highly recommend BRS Grandeur to anyone looking for a premium venue with excellent service, impeccable cleanliness, and a team that genuinely cares about delivering a flawless event.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnD_pNPKLKHQ3Rj-VouQEPKz9xoKsJNSXeSgMFoiByhjzNKm8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJTbQHEts_rjsRA06141khfZU-rev-2",
        "author": "Weekend Scout",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "Liked the banquet hall for its big size and flexibility, the stage is huge and allows for a lot of design and decoration opportunities. The hall can easily accommodate 800-900 people and they AC works! Unlike most other halls.\nThe same cannot be said about the dining hall, for starters they did not turn on the AC even upon request and another major flaw is it is open to the outside directly from the back, meaning a lot of strangers and outsiders just crash in for the food, this needs to be corrected and fixed.\nThe changing rooms and the Bride and Groom rooms are spacious and well maintained. They also have a dedicated make up salon if you have a beautician hired.\nParking space is vast but there is no shade, during my visit it was raining and by the time we could walk from the car to the hall we were already in the rain getting wet.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVfzkETLHxuLQ4WBbUrDsxOitKxSE5e7r86jthwDrxZKr_n6Qs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJTbQHEts_rjsRA06141khfZU-rev-3",
        "author": "re thippeswamy",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "It is a big Function Hall. Suitable for a crowd of around 500 guests. Good & Big dining hall. Sufficient Parking Place is also available. Very positive and Plus point is, it is at a walkable distance from Talaghattapura Metro station.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUOgtK9bSYOwvmKpu5MGLBp4elkB4iWG6kwFmXp-X0ZkG-WRoo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "eventType": "Sangeet & Engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "ChIJTbQHEts_rjsRA06141khfZU-rev-4",
        "author": "Nagaraj N",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "This premium wedding place is Grand in every aspect as its named. Located at Vajarahalli before Talaghattapura on Kanakapura road, it's close to the Green line Metro station too. Alighting point for Metro users is Talaghattapura station which is just 5 mins of walk.\n\nVast car parking which can accommodate approx. 400 cars, spacious lobby area & big big banquet hall which is Air conditioned with nice interiors. The hall can accommodate at least 1,000 people with a big spacious stage. It boasts of having suite & executive rooms in the 1st floor along with a roof top open terrace for buffet arrangements. It also has an Air conditioned sitting dining hall on the Ground floor for accomodating approx 500 people.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWGjFTifAnUFRDv7GwhjWvwCB0IHPOkFbuQLOd_BCWOpaYniAx-g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "eventType": "Wedding & Reception"
      }
    ]
