        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "This is a medium to large size wedding hall. It is has the dining hall in the basement and the ground floor is divided in two. One is the wedding hall to which the entrance door is attached. Second is towards the right side, there are room and restrooms for the guests or the bride/groom and their families. There is no facility for A/C at the hall and only fans are present (it may be hotter during summers). It also has a second floor which contains rooms too. The parking space is quite small inside on either sides of the compound. If space is available, one can park on the roads as well.",
