        "comment": "Utsavaa in Electronic City is a sprawling, 14-acre premium venue renowned for its grand banquet halls and expansive lawns, perfect for hosting large-scale weddings and events. It offers top-tier amenities, including significant on-site parking and modern event infrastructure, ensuring a seamless experience for thousands of guests. Its blend of lush, aesthetic outdoor spaces and sophisticated indoor halls makes it a highly sought-after destination for grand celebrations in South Bangalore.",
