        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "One of the clean place to have a party for 100 people. Well maintained, Nice ambiance, the stage speaker mic setup, the kitchen all are well planned. The washrooms are neat. Parking is shared and little less, but that is the problem every where in electronic city. The price is on little higher side and variable charges like floor cleaning, kitchen cleaning, garbage dumping all are extra this will you pinch a little more .",
