        "rating": 4,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "This hall is located on a 2 lane side street along Neeladri Road. It is good a small to medium sized event/ occassion.Located on the terrace, it has a high ceiling of  insulated  FRP sheets. It was maintained reasonably cool with room coolers.It has a bright, well ventilated ambience. Wall gardens made it simple but beautiful. It is just one space with an offset where dining space can be set up for about 40-50 persons.",
