        "id": "ChIJBeNdGgBrrjsR28og3fl7Qyo-rev-2",
        "author": "Emb usha",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "7 months ago",
        "comment": "Great Function Hall for Electronic City Events!\nWe recently hosted an event at this function hall, and it exceeded our expectations. The hall is spacious and clean, making it perfect for weddings, parties, or corporate gatherings. If you’re based in Electronic City, this is an ideal venue—super convenient location with ample parking space available right on-site, so no worries about vehicles.\nThey allow non-veg catering, but you need to bring it from outside, which gives you flexibility to choose your favorite vendors. Overall, a reliable choice for hassle-free events!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS8E8JD6V6142i20Nt2hiKRnxvEyiSOazlHUEzcNVQGQj3vOs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
