        "author": "Sachin Gopal",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "5 months ago",
        "comment": "Recently attended a graduation ceremony here and the hall is well lit, good airflow and the infrastructure setup is also excellent. Ample parking too.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVdMF9N73hMl9y7G8nU6qmtlANDIF82hevIHgk-zNn4t9OogW8RMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
