        "rating": 5,
        "date": "3 years ago",
        "comment": "Recently, did a function at this conventional hall and overall the experience was very nice. Hall is spacious and very well designed to have natural light. It is neatly maintained. There is lawn area outside the hall which is nice. Also, sufficient space for vehicle parking which is a plus. Management are also helpful. Would really recommend if someone is looking for mid-size (~200-300) attendance. However, they can accommodate even more.",
