        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Excellent Banquet Hall with Outstanding services & Appetizing food….This Venue is stunning and perfect for large gatherings…..we celebrated our son’s first birthday Last week and had an unforgettable experience ! The staff  went above and beyond to make our special day indelible. The food was exceptional and flavoured Mr. Arpit deserves special praise for ensuring the entire event seamless and stress-free",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfR_0XGZn3z_2xy4irCfgXST1K7sWLhzqX8QIS-r8aAg9rsJhA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
