        "date": "a year ago",
        "comment": "Unforgettable celebration! We recently hosted our son's 1st birthday party here and it was truly exceptional. The food was divine, our guests couldn't stop raving about it! Arpit, the owner, went above and beyond to ensure every detail was perfect. Special thanks to Shweta for adding that extra touch of warmth and care. The overall experience was seamless and memorable. Highly recommend for any special occasion!",
