        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "I had a truly wonderful experience at Nirvigna Conventional Centre! ✨ The venue is outstanding and perfectly suited for various events. The atmosphere was incredibly inviting and well-maintained. Highly recommended for any occasion! 👍😊",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIg1xmYSKRV6aQ7LzAd5dP19mKaLKIe0w8HWIVvoD9E6cnR2w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
