        "rating": 5,
        "date": "7 years ago",
        "comment": "Very Surprised to see such a peaceful place in Bangalore. Been here for a health Camp, the place is managed well, has a Lake very next to the property, around 3.5 acre. It was about 1200-1400 Rs per head including 3 meals which was delicious by the way, Veg and Non Veg are served need to specify to the host. Not a business setup more so for Private or Casual Meets seminars etc. Lots of trees, quiet, away from busy traffic really was a treat to me.",
