        "rating": 4,
        "date": "11 months ago",
        "comment": "Really great service they provides.\nAll staffs are very polite and helpful.Nice place for small functions like birthday, wedding reception...\n\nThe food they served was very delicious, how can i describes i don't know. All the items are really yummy.",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU4FUPcqpbbLQw23-npMIy-EcyZv-zXl32wCLGUD2cIDwuel5Qw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7",
