        "author": "Harikrishnan Gopalakrishnan",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "6 years ago",
        "comment": "My daughter's birthday party was hosted in this brand new banquet hall. Located on outer ring road opposite to rainbow hospital. Ideal for holding birthday parties and get-together parties. Overall ambience of the hall is the main highlight. Well managed with good flexibility in food menu selection. Reasonable parking facility.",
