        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 years ago",
        "comment": "I had my wedding reception hosted in Loire Party Hall. The owner Mr Abdul went above and beyond to help us with our decoration. He is a very honest man and gave me some very good suggestions for the decorations and accommodated all the additional requests I made. Everything was ready by the time the guests started arriving and the entire hall looked so beautiful, especially from outside with all the lighting and flower decorations that his team did. The stage was tastefully decorated with elegant structures and color combinations. We were so happy when we saw the stage for the first time 😇.\n\nEven washrooms and wash basins were kept clean the entire time for the guests.\n\nThey charged a very reasonable amount and more than anything I would rebook the whole place again only because of the owner's genuineness and honesty.",
