        "comment": "The resort looks really elegant giving a royal feel and ample space for events. Had a very good and pleasant experience!\n\nBut this is situated more towards the inside from the Hoskote Junction making it likely less convenient for travel. But the place is damn beautiful!!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEEmwDdJW4qrRjwTuPhC0TP4a-rJUn_8T9L0z2aimsZa0YPLCutg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
