        "comment": "Place is nicely crafted.Good parking place and ample place for all types of events",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1OmYALtFgZoWQsIvEjran_60MA29Dx-fSbf4HIQaPQLt-7w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
