        "rating": 5,
        "date": "2 months ago",
        "comment": "Had halfsaree function for my daugther. Hall was sapcious and was very convinient where we hosted around 130+ people.\nManager Ramesh was co-operative and responsive and helped arranging for Caterers and Decorators. Food from caterers was great too. All in all had great experience.",
