        "date": "3 weeks ago",
        "comment": "⭐ Excellent stay: “Had a wonderful stay! The rooms were clean and comfortable, the staff were friendly and helpful, and the service was excellent. Highly recommended!”\n⭐ Short & classy: “Beautiful hotel, great service, spotless rooms, and a very pleasant atmosphere. Would definitely stay here again.”\n⭐ Luxury: “A fantastic experience from start to finish. Elegant rooms, excellent hospitality, and top-notch service. Truly worth the stay.”\n⭐ Family stay: “We had a very comfortable stay with our family. The rooms were spacious and clean, the staff were courteous, and everything was well maintained.”\n⭐ Budget hotel: “Great value for money. Clean rooms, good facilities, friendly staff, and a convenient location. Highly recommended.”\n⭐ 5-star style: “Absolutely loved my stay! Exceptional hospitality, immaculate rooms, delicious food, and attentive service. One of the best hotel experiences I’ve had.”\n\nAmit karishma and arpitha were very good at organising the event\nThe best past of the event is the quality and taste and guess what u will need to pay for only food and place is free",
