        "comment": "We celebrated our daughter's first birthday at Isha Banquet Hall, and it was a wonderful experience. The staff was extremely courteous and supportive throughout the event. A special thanks to Ashwithy, who did an excellent job as the coordinator and facilitator, ensuring everything ran smoothly. Also, I'd like to give compliments to chef Amit & Giri for the delicious food, every dish was excellent and our guests loved it. Thank you to the entire team for making our celebration so memorable. Highly recommended!",
