        "comment": "Booked for my daughter birthday\nI had an amazing experience at The Binge Town - Whitefield - Private theatre venues for celebrations. The private theatre setup is perfect for celebrations—great ambiance, comfortable seating, and excellent sound quality. The decorations were beautifully done and exactly as promised.\n\nThe staff was very friendly and helpful, making the whole experience smooth and memorable. It’s a perfect place for birthdays, surprises, or special moments with loved ones.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a unique and fun celebration experience!",
