        "author": "Harinath Reddy",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "a week ago",
        "comment": "Had an amazing birthday celebration at Eden Theatre! In bingetown🎉❤️\nEverything was perfectly arranged—from the beautiful decoration and delicious food to the photos and videos. The smoke entry was a fantastic touch and made the celebration feel extra special! ✨📸\n\nThe entire setup was beautiful, and the team did a great job making the experience memorable and hassle-free. Highly recommended for anyone looking to celebrate a birthday or special occasion in a unique way. 🎂🥳",
