        "author": "Abhisek Patra",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "4 months ago",
        "comment": "Had a wonderful birthday celebration at Bing Town! My wife booked a surprise birthday celebration for me there, and the entire experience turned out to be truly memorable. The ambience was enjoyable, the staff were cooperative, and everything was arranged very nicely.\n\nOne thing I especially liked was the professional photographer service — the photos came out amazing and captured the special moments perfectly. The cake was fresh, tasty, and available at genuine pricing, which made the experience even better.\n\nOverall, it was a fantastic and hassle-free celebration. Big thanks to the Bing Town team for making my surprise birthday so special. Highly recommended for birthdays and special occasions!",
        "avatarUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVD7btepjYWvWX-AUNdGh_al5E7BnMZ8IevU8V1Zbjy9KNllN_v=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
